    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/500100202/5001002020221"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……みんな、どうした？\r\nよかったら──何があったか、話してくれないか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "スタジオだと人目があるから話せなかったんだろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今なら、まわりに誰もいないから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 5001002020222,
    "speaker": "一同",
    "text": "っ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/500100202/5001002020222"
  },
  {
    "id": 5001002020223,
    "speaker": "一同",
    "text": "……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/500100202/5001002020223"
  },
  {
    "id": 5001002020230,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……あのね、プロデューサー",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/500100202/5001002020230"
  },
  {
    "id": 5001002020240,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "わたしたち──さっき、ディレクターさんに\r\nすっごく褒めてもらえたの",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/500100202/5001002020240"
  },
  {
    "id": 5001002020250,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "『今日のトークはすごく良かった』\r\n『３人ともキラキラしてて可愛かった』って──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/500100202/5001002020250"
  },
  {
    "id": 5001002020260,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/500100202/5001002020260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……うん\r\n……それで？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 5001002020270,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……それでね、だから……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/500100202/5001002020270"
  },
  {
    "id": 5001002020280,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "『もう頑張ったらダメ』だって……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/500100202/5001002020280"
  },
  {
    "id": 5001002020290,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……『アイドルは可愛いことがすべて』だから……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/500100202/5001002020290"
  },
  {
    "id": 5001002020300,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "『ちょっとできてないところもある、\r\n今ぐらいがちょうどいい』って……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/500100202/5001002020300"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それは──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
